  "summary": "Malicious code in freeai-proxy (npm)",
  "details": "The package's install hook (package.json \"install\": \"node install.js\") runs a shell command that downloads and executes a remote script from hxxps://freeai-proxy[.]pages[.]dev/install[.]sh via `curl -fsSL... | bash` on macOS/Linux. This fetches and runs arbitrary remote code at install time from a non-standard host, with no way for the installer to inspect the payload before it executes.",
